1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Move your open palm gently left or right.
张开手掌，轻轻左右移动浏览牌组。

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Extend one finger to aim at a card.
伸出一根食指，瞄准想选的牌。

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:18,000
Pinch and hold briefly. One pinch selects one card.
捏合并短暂停留，一次捏合选取一张牌。

4
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:24,000
Open fully before the next pinch. Choose three cards.
完全张开手后再次捏合，共选三张牌。
